What is Central Reservation System Software?
Central Reservation System (CRS) Software is a specialized technology platform designed to streamline booking management and inventory distribution for hotels and hospitality businesses. These systems enable properties to manage reservations across multiple channels, optimize room rates dynamically, and integrate with property management systems (PMS) and revenue management tools. Key capabilities include real-time availability updates, multi-property coordination, and automated rate parity enforcement across OTAs, direct booking engines, and global distribution systems.

